    "Routing-only AnyNetGo/sing-box-style config generated from shadowrocket-auto.conf.",
    "Proxy node credentials are not embedded here; they must come from your AnyNetGo subscription/account.",
    "Rules are compacted into grouped route blocks to reduce matching overhead.",
    "FAST_AUTO is intentionally limited to nearby/common fast nodes for rules that explicitly use it.",
    "Unmatched traffic uses DIRECT so WeChat and other mainland apps do not wait for domain or GeoIP classification before connecting.",
    "DNS uses IPv4-only answers and reverse mapping to avoid slow IPv6 video startup and improve direct-domain classification on Apple platforms."
